9\nCREATED: 2026-06-13\nDOMAIN: asiaone.com\nSLUG: china-strongly-dissatisfied-pentagon-move-against-top-chinese-tech-firms\nTEXT: China is "strongly dissatisfied" with a US move to add several large Chinese companies, including Alibaba and Baidu, to the Pentagon\'s list of firms aiding China\'s military. The Commerce Ministry expressed concern about the US Defence Department\'s update, which also included automakers BYD and NIO, as well as solar panel makers Trina Solar and JA Solar Technology.\n\n\n',)
